    "Id": "mechdef_aries_ARS-B",
    "Name": "Aries B",
    "Details": "Configuration B features a mix of energy and missile weapons, including a Large Pulse Laser in the left arm and two Large Pulse Lasers in the right arm. It mounts Improved ATM 12 missile launchers on both left and right torsos with ample ammo stored in various locations. The mech also includes an Angel ECM Suite for electronic warfare and a Targeting Computer to enhance accuracy. Mobility is supported by Jump Jets in the center torso and both legs. The design is cooled by 18 double heat sinks for effective heat management.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
